[00:00.00] 作词 : David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:Moon_the_Voyager]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[00:23.09]Heaven sent the promised land
[00:23.09]这里真像是上天赐予的应许之地
[00:28.56]Looks alright from where I stand
[00:28.56]一切在我看来刚刚好
[00:33.97]Cause I'm the man on the outside looking in
[00:33.97]因为我从没来过这，我还在外面，我还满怀期许
[00:45.03]Waiting on the first step
[00:45.03]在第一级台阶我停下脚步
[00:50.46]Show me where the key is kept
[00:50.46]请告诉我这儿的钥匙在哪
[00:55.99]Point me down the right line because it's time
[00:55.99]时间快到了吧，我站在这就好吗
[01:05.94]To let me in from the cold
[01:05.94]外面好冷，让我进去吧
[01:11.85]Turn my lead into gold
[01:11.85]那里有我生命中迫切渴望的爱与温暖
[01:16.82]Cause there's a chill wind blowing in my soul
[01:16.82]我感到我的内心有寒风吹过
[01:21.91]And I think I'm growing old
[01:21.91]我想我在慢慢变老
[01:29.39]Flash the readies 
[01:29.39]摸出些零碎钞票
[01:32.11]Wot's...Uh the deal
[01:32.11]‘这些多少钱’
[01:34.88]Got to make to the next meal
[01:34.88]余下的还得挺到下一顿才能花
[01:40.38]Try to keep up with the turning of the wheel
[01:40.38]努力跟上节奏，不被生活的齿轮碾碎
[01:51.29]Mile after mile, Stone after stone
[01:51.29]这样跋涉过大半辈子
[01:56.85]Turn to speak but you're alone 
[01:56.85]想和谁说说话，转过头才发现你孑然一身
[02:02.28]Million miles from home you're on your own
[02:02.28]离家万里，却始终独自走过
[02:11.81]So let me in from the cold
[02:11.81]让我进去吧，那扇没有为我开启的门
[02:17.32]Turn my lead into gold
[02:17.32]让我失落的生命重新丰盈
[02:22.69]Cause there's a chill wind blowing in my soul
[02:22.69]因为我灰暗破碎的内心里寒风呼啸依旧
[02:27.42]And I think I'm growing old
[02:27.42]我想我会越来越老
[03:39.53]Fire bright by candlelight
[03:39.53]烛光摇曳，炉火明亮
[03:44.58]With her by my side
[03:44.58]她依偎在我身边
[03:49.92]And if she prefers we will never stir again
[03:49.92]我想我们会就这样一动不动，直到永远永远
[04:00.57]Someone sent the promised land
[04:00.57]我全力抓住
[04:05.86]And I grabbed it with both hands
[04:05.86]这所有美好
[04:11.27]Now I'm the man on the inside looking out
[04:11.27]现在是我坐在里面，望向窗外曾经的我
[04:20.83]Hear me shout 'Come on in,
[04:20.83]听我喊道，“进来吧，
[04:25.87]'What's the news and where you been'
[04:25.87]”有什么消息吗，你打哪来“
[04:31.19]Cause there's no wind left in my soul
[04:31.19]我心中的寒风早就荡然无存
[04:36.08]And I've grown old
